{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の握手会レポブログで載せてなかったから\n成人式の写メ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\n改めてお集まりいただきまして\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、玲香との乃木のの\n聴いてくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫でしたかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の成人式の挨拶とかしてて\n気づいたら終わってた(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので、聞けなかったのです(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想コメントお待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また玲香じゃないってゆー(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日玲香と写メ撮ったんだけどね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もはや玲香との写メ\n載せたくなくなってきた(・∀・)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと久々の\n飯ぺろ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エコール・クリオロの\nガイア\nという名前のケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナッツの香りとか\nサクサクの触感とか\n濃厚なキャラメルの層とか\nほどよい甘さの滑らかなバニラクリームとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべてが計算しつくされてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べてる間ずっと感動してた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/01/19/2570977/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の飾りのチョコも深みのある味で\nぬかりない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ本当に美味しいです(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近バレンタイン近いから\nバレンタイン限定スイーツが出始めて気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年こそは\n目標達成できますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}